which is the hardest sell.

00:11:14.173 --> 00:11:16.042
- If you talk 
about the news now,

00:11:16.042 --> 00:11:18.278
if they just sat there
going, "everything's great",

00:11:18.278 --> 00:11:20.380
it doesn't resonate with people.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.848
- First of all they're wrong.

00:11:21.848 --> 00:11:25.084
You're either on 
offense or you're not.

00:11:25.689 --> 00:11:29.313
Like, to me, dwelling is
super not interesting.

00:11:29.313 --> 00:11:31.571
It's got zero value.

00:11:32.549 --> 00:11:35.152
You need to be thoughtful,
you need to understand,

00:11:35.152 --> 00:11:37.220
you need to not have
too much ego to lack the

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.422
humility that why 
did we get here.

00:11:39.422 --> 00:11:41.291
But, dwelling?

00:11:41.291 --> 00:11:43.093
I'm not interested in
dwelling of what just

00:11:43.093 --> 00:11:44.294
happened in our countries.

00:11:44.294 --> 00:11:46.730
I'm interested in 
being on the offense to

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:50.433
A, start closing the
gap back to the social.

00:11:50.433 --> 00:11:53.103
I care about the social impacts.

00:12:02.121 --> 00:12:04.490
I sent an e-mail to the
entire company today

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:07.093
of an emoji heart, that was it.

00:12:07.093 --> 00:12:07.948
Or I think I wrote something,

00:12:07.948 --> 00:12:08.849
like "I love you" or something.

00:12:08.849 --> 00:12:12.799
But, the e-mails that 
I got back were so insane.

00:12:12.799 --> 00:12:15.899
Like, just like, 
people needed it.

00:12:15.899 --> 00:12:19.405
It takes so little to do, 
it's so easy to say,

00:12:19.405 --> 00:12:23.142
"hey", or wink at somebody, 
or just smile,

00:12:23.142 --> 00:12:24.367
but it's not.

00:12:24.367 --> 00:12:26.810
Because you actually 
have to believe it.

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:29.222
And people don't 
actually believe it.

00:12:29.222 --> 00:12:31.668
This is negative, like, 
I want to be on the offense

00:12:31.668 --> 00:12:36.329
of positivity, not dwell and
understand how we got here.

00:12:36.329 --> 00:12:38.358
1:02 in the morning.

