London.

00:12:41.211 --> 00:12:45.531
Good productive day, nice 45
minute with my homie, Shawn.

00:12:47.133 --> 00:12:50.785
And, it's time to 
get some sleep.

00:12:53.613 --> 00:12:54.941
Alright, Shawn, see you later.

